<title>USA: Transcend Therapeutics IPO postponed.</title>
<headline>Transcend Therapeutics IPO postponed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The initial public offering of Transcend Therapeutics Inc has been postponed, according to lead underwriter Vector Securities International Inc.</p>
<p>The company had proposed to offer two million shares in range of $12 to $14. Transcend develops pharmaceuticals to treate deseases casued by oxidative stress.</p>
<p>The initial public offerring could possibly be rescheduled in 1997, Vector said.</p>
</text>
